01:45:10.733 --> 01:45:58.833
Masuknya dalam banget. Kerasa enak?

01:46:00.266 --> 01:46:01.300
Iya, enak banget.

01:46:08.533 --> 01:46:09.700
Ganjal, nih.

01:46:19.000 --> 01:46:20.000
Coba...

01:46:46.966 --> 01:46:52.300
sekali lagi.

01:46:52.800 --> 01:46:54.400
Pengen dari belakang, deh.

01:46:58.233 --> 01:46:59.600
Coba nungging.

01:47:08.833 --> 01:47:13.800
Sampai nungging gitu ya, Yuuka. Kamu mau diapain?

01:47:33.566 --> 01:47:34.566
Mau gerak sendiri?

01:49:50.166 --> 01:49:52.800
Punya Kakak beneran enak banget.

01:49:55.300 --> 01:49:59.933
Punya Yuuka juga. Enak, kan?

01:50:10.400 --> 01:50:11.766
Punyaku pasti paling mantap, kan?

01:50:13.600 --> 01:50:17.633
Punya Kakak lebih besar, keras, dan enak banget.

01:50:19.300 --> 01:51:00.866
Coba sekali lagi. Kelihatan?

01:51:02.800 --> 01:51:03.800
Oke.

01:51:04.800 --> 01:51:05.866
Punya Yuuka-chan sampai menonjol nih.

01:51:54.633 --> 01:51:56.233
Kakak agresif banget.

01:51:56.900 --> 01:51:58.333
Kok berhenti?

01:51:58.433 --> 01:51:59.433
Enggak mau.

01:54:46.866 --> 01:54:52.000
Aku tahu Kakak bukan orang baik, tapi apa kita masih bisa ketemu lagi?

01:54:53.266 --> 01:54:54.333
Pasti bisa.

01:54:55.700 --> 01:54:56.700
Aku senang.

01:54:59.100 --> 01:55:00.100
Aku juga pengen ketemu lagi.

01:55:23.800 --> 01:55:24.800
Apa pun boleh kok.

01:56:43.200 --> 01:56:45.266
Kakak juga masih kaku, lho.

01:56:47.600 --> 01:56:52.833
Habisnya main sama Yuuka-chan enak banget. Mau lagi?

01:56:52.833 --> 01:56:53.833
Iya.

01:57:05.766 --> 01:57:09.000
Kalau sama Kakak, aku mau melakukannya berkali-kali.
